[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-75065"] :question/problem "Let $R=[2,4]\\times [2,4]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=2x+y+1.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}={{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}},\\,{P}_{2}={{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the upper Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The upper Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{M}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${M}_{ij}$ is the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/assets/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=2x+y+1$ increases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=2x+y+1$ increases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/assets/67daa328cc6ae4cb37be386c327fb4548844fad2adc10476bdf1147c5a5d4218.png)\n\nAs a result, the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top right corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/assets/6e58954fccd74eaf67c95df818c4c9050c35b324c5fffe4902a366cb295b8845.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=2{x}_{i}+{y}_{j}+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(2{x}_{i}+{y}_{j}+1)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $2{x}_{i}+{y}_{j}+1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-75332/selection/660f00f6dfc57725153b44359f60b21bf0917e8423218751b6e7079330de3813" :answer/id #uuid "e25a79e0-fb26-5569-a49e-c0fdb2e9d073" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11{x}_{i}+7{y}_{j}+14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75332/selection/b2b0dab0550b26ccdc2a987f0c0c9ab698a3548d56c4ef5a8f74c8c8e99832e8" :answer/id #uuid "7b5b7b61-6233-5aff-a940-ba63932b7e27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11{x}_{i-1}+7{y}_{j-1}+14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75332/selection/95d4bd871328e019fa01fb447ed41785880773cf10c90faeb173476ebb457285" :answer/id #uuid "c5364ec8-6baa-5ab7-a41b-7700e5a97cf5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5{x}_{i-1}-{y}_{j-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75332/selection/81adffc557c66e063a6480ef783ae4214fb2df4eae4a736ab321deb6c126f862" :answer/id #uuid "94dc27ec-76f7-5476-8199-af9d60a19346" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11{x}_{i}+7{y}_{j-1}+14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75332/selection/694a666965f92e82f91b4bc74e307b63c750549eb61ffba66be745feec762efb" :answer/id #uuid "d3d34c11-8bfc-559b-8574-ca7428c28b4e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5{x}_{i}-{y}_{j}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75332/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "cbb6cc57-4cd5-500a-9d24-636e473fb0ed" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-75332/selection/660f00f6dfc57725153b44359f60b21bf0917e8423218751b6e7079330de3813" :answer-field/choices ["q-75332/selectio