the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom left corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/assets/5b9967c814e46914e0409854de0960e85339adc9b9fd9693677c8e048c342702.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j-1})=18-3{x}_{i-1}^{2}-5{y}_{j-1}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(18-3{x}_{i-1}^{2}-5{y}_{j-1}^{2})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $18-3{x}_{i-1}^{2}-5{y}_{j-1}^{2}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-75345/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a5c07033-ef84-52e6-bd08-b1f0cc289e9f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-75345"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75338/selection/3e7557e5576e363da72b192cc287d2ef60e8890013d49cc9da705b03979996d0" :answer/id #uuid "447b11db-5a42-5c11-8d32-df2822c95231" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "17-{x}_{i}-4{y}_{j-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75338/selection/966bc3df69d4130abe9550614128f877459279ff669aecb0734b769e7b3ca5b2" :answer/id #uuid "a44f3740-83bf-55e9-812f-7e8d2452d26d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "17-{x}_{i-1}-4{y}_{j}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75338/selection/5847aabb89e7e1c72cb3bda1c9903f2afdc7845612ad5f21752cd79d9736b8b7" :answer/id #uuid "7908c932-7258-5704-b6d4-6ad4170dcb80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6{x}_{i-1}-{y}_{j-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75338/selection/78d03c30b55ce98370c16046aef2f8546fe5c2555200e16895788184c55c42b4" :answer/id #uuid "159f5b22-268d-5c8b-aaa2-bb45ca9d921e" :answer/type :a