-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/assets/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)={x}^{2}-5{y}^{3}$ decreases as $x$ increases on $[-2,0],$ and\n\n- $f(x,y)={x}^{2}-5{y}^{3}$ decreases as $y$ increases on $[-2,2].$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/assets/ce0d90127e1f14654f4b32a933f1eb6e76e054c03f19ca40c3f04116aa3c2c93.png)\n\nAs a result, the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom left corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/assets/5b9967c814e46914e0409854de0960e85339adc9b9fd9693677c8e048c342702.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j-1})={x}_{i-1}^{2}-5{y}_{j-1}^{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}({x}_{i-1}^{2}-5{y}_{j-1}^{3})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is ${x}_{i-1}^{2}-5{y}_{j-1}^{3}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-170682/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a5c07033-ef84-52e6-bd08-b1f0cc289e9f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-170682"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-170683/selection/f871d9c58723f1c50b6c8a0bbd3abad5d301a1a678549cb4e01340513de08ad4" :answer/id #uuid "6b0099ad-3533-5bc6-9aa5-b7c80640798e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i}-5{y}_{j-1}+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170683/selection/03e6d6aae8db800b42fb0e1aa66b7d97a3a41326c9f07fcdd7cce8a0278740fc" :answer/id #uuid "c766a63f-b440-5a42-b81f-1ba3ccdb77d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i-1}+7{y}_{j-1}+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170683/selection/05877273091af801e7d68d1097cc2e08e6f2069349f1c766da3880b241fe7ae8" :answer/id #uuid "e8001526-b1f3-5e62-b0ac-5ddb604d7185" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i}-5{y}_{j}+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170683/selection/c34bab35f7962c07e547ca6d3b06c0d4abe3cd85755119ebbd679c7cf8c0e328" :answer/id #uuid "889767ce-dff1-575b-9427-d8c7de94dfdf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{x}_{i-1}-5{y}_{j-1}+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170683/selection/d5158677018568ffa4388b84123fe4243f05d768ac2affaba8e539796be5c2e3" :answer/id #uuid "80ed9c60-c9d2-5f5a-819a-44b511323618" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}_{i}+7{y}_{j-1}+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-170683/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e18b32be-1c68-5169-a74a-48b3709863d2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-170683/selection/f871d9c58723f1c50b6c8a0bbd3abad5d301a1a678549cb4e01340513de08ad4" :answer-field/choices ["q-170683/selection/f871d9c58723f1c50b6c8a0bbd3abad5d301a1a678549cb4e01340513de08ad4" "q-170683/selection/03e6d6aae8db800b42fb0e1aa66b7d97a3a41326c9f07fcdd7cce8a0278740fc" "q-170683/selection/05877273091af801e7d68d1097cc2e08e6f2069349f1c766da3880b241fe7ae8" "q-170683/selection/c34bab35f7962c07e547ca6d3b06c0d4abe3cd85755119ebbd679c7cf8c0e328" "q-170683/selection/d5158677018568ffa4388b84123fe4243f05d768ac2affaba8e539796be5c2e3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-170683" :question/id #uuid "a066c4a1-78a1-508f-ac0c-43ce8957533e" :question/math-academy-id "q-170683" :question/problem "Let $R=[3,4]\\times [-2,5]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=3x-5y+1.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}={{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}},\\,{P}_{2}={{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the upper Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nU(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$\nwhat is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The upper Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{M}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${M}_{ij}$ is the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/assets/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=3x-5y+1$ increases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=3x-5y+1$ decreases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/assets/01b291ca7cd81b88cf6ed06fdcdb2ffcbb1f78255d0f57d496823d347c2fb0b3.png)\n\nAs a result, the *maximum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *smallest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *bottom right corner* of each subregion.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/assets/de36b521dea1f925754a9c630c3d4a2c405c087a191138f1eaaa5771becb8c21.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j-1})=3{x}_{i}-5{y}_{j-1}+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(3{x}_{i}-5{y}_{j-1}+1)Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $3{x}_{i}-5{y}_{j-1}+1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-170683/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b815d42d-8e8a-5036-b6c4-76e4c20b20b7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-170683"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123589/selection/ce4441006c947b465ffdf7fdac590bfd6ee805962956098458f56a333165f762" :answer/id #uuid "01b41f70-fa08-505b-91db-58b3bbffa7c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{y}_{j-1}-{x}_{i-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123589/selection/821bafed2c33b720abc14c6a00d420484bd9f58b74dd3d638e8fc0fbc8887941" :answer/id #uuid "9e21a3d8-1f4a-5a0a-bf77-c4c02426f064" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{y}_{j}-{x}_{i-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123589/selection/a9eb12d1ce0f54444f1bd862633e575d7b43b9478b44f0c9d4e3237aa1581e46" :answer/id #uuid "39c2b423-6bfb-5c1a-a22b-022bc9008990" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{y}_{j}-{x}_{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123589/selection/23aa8e3d1463e8e657aea94f8627c79fe310ef16cea075c890480f120a5fcbc1" :answer/id #uuid "291ba459-ca01-5fb4-86bc-c4fc16e13a63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{y}_{j-1}-{x}_{i}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123589/selection/80324c5f5e940ecb0835ad62e7aab1bd5d6e6547d979bc9b24c61806d7ad0321" :answer/id #uuid "658fab8d-3801-5d52-975d-56a6a7bc819d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{y}_{j}-{x}_{i-1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123589/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0c2509ec-d670-5b5a-b6a8-6b1b7201de06" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123589/selection/80324c5f5e940ecb0835ad62e7aab1bd5d6e6547d979bc9b24c61806d7ad0321" :answer-field/choices ["q-123589/selection/ce4441006c947b465ffdf7fdac590bfd6ee805962956098458f56a333165f762" "q-123589/selection/821bafed2c33b720abc14c6a00d420484bd9f58b74dd3d638e8f