$f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *smallest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top left corner* of each subregion.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14072435/assets/74d546d91e145efea49b70af56cb472e8bbbd1417725cd7fa92a3a278cad75ea.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{M}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i-1},{y}_{j})=5{y}_{j}-{x}_{i-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the upper Riemann sum is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}U(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(5{y}_{j}-{x}_{i-1})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $5{y}_{j}-{x}_{i-1}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-123589/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b815d42d-8e8a-5036-b6c4-76e4c20b20b7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123589"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-122841/selection/8177eb495202bc357e0da89ecbf8c9b7cc83a95c8ec97284b733f06ff1d3790c" :answer/id #uuid "87fe8524-60b5-584e-8e69-b704cdda4e79" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7{x}_{i-1}-11{y}_{j}+5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122841/selection/10bb5651a399fcc59fcc1e7909048ed776724626e8eb9bc4966719a37267790e" :answer/id #uuid "a4572ffa-4a96-506d-a389-0baed3bb4b8d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7{x}_{i}-11{y}_{j}+5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122841/selection/0c0ab6ab353f72e91b184e2bd2cd3028b05e0e0b5ffb35c89d1526fd694c054b" :answer/id #uuid "63cb2fe1-e436-597f-a967-1e56e000c1a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7{x}_{i}-11{y}_{j-1}+5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-122841/selection/57de0fbe5aa46105182885dd637d686063cdfc40f94ff8ab1dc57a1240646152" :answer/id #uuid "faa60f19-3e8a-54a6-917c-e8900c840487" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5{x}_{i}-{y}_{j-1}" :db/ensure [:answe